WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:13.110 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  october is nigh  and the month is kicking off with a trio  of huge games  this episode of new releases is taking a  look at the whole month so strap in for  platforming mascots  spaceships and dystopian adventures  let's take a look at a few of the  hottest games launching in the new month  kicking things off on day one is none  other than mario himself  with super mario bros 35 this is a 35  player battle royale version of classic  mario brothers  so every enemy you defeat gets sent to  an opponent's screen  last plumber's standing wins as you  might have guessed from the name  super mario bros 35 is celebrating the  series 35th anniversary  and it'll be available as a free  download for nintendo switch online  members  starting thursday october 1st just be  aware that this game will  go away after march 31st of next year  and now for mario's retro rival crash  bandicoot  crash 4 it's about time is dropping at  the top of the month  bringing a whole new suite of  challenging levels to jump and spin  through as crash  coco neocortex and even dingodile and  tauna  you can unlock bonus flashback levels  and an inverted mode that remixes the  stages you already conquered  and expect to bend all sorts of physics  with the new masks too crash 4 lands on  ps4 and xbox one on friday october 2nd  now let's head to a galaxy far far away  with star wars squadrons  if you've been itching to get back into  the cockpit of a tie fighter or x-wing  now's your chance this game has a story  mode pitting the rebels against the  empire  deathmatch style multiplayer dog fights  and capture point based fleet battles  squadrons takes flight on ps4 xbox one  and pc on the second  and yes you can fly in vr if you've got  the headset for it  just remember to wear your helmet for  safety have you been  fine sir good it's a good thing you were  wearing that helmet  yeah back on earth  things are getting dicey and watchdogs  legion the open world adventure is set  in a dystopian future where the city of  london  is under the military rule of the albion  company fortunately  dedsec is here to fight against them and  you can recruit characters to the cause  as you carry out missions however you  want across the city  which characters can you recruit that's  the thing watchdogs legion lets you play  as  anyone if you can get them on your side  you can build your team on ps4 xbox one  pc and stadia on thursday the 29th  and yes there will be ps5 series x and  series s versions later too  we started the month at nintendo and  we're going to close there too thanks to  pikmin 3 deluxe  this re-release includes the original  pikmin 3 all of its dlc  and a new set of side missions for  olomar and louis there are also new  co-op options too  so you can once again explore the planet  pluck pikmin and collect spaceship parts  with a friend  pikmin 3 deluxe comes to switch on  friday the 30th closing out the month  and those are some of the hottest games  launching all month long as always  remember that release dates are based on  retailer listings and are subject to  change  thanks for watching everyone and i'll be  back with a closer look at more october  games next sunday  [Music]

